  "caveats": [
    "Cedar CPU units are relative 1x/12x/50x, not vCPUs; do not equate them. Fir Compute 4CPU/8GB $300/month needs Private Space; public table alone does not yield all-in total. Eco $5 is 1000-hour shared pool, not per-dyno always-on rate. Disk ephemeral, paid data separate.",
